{"agent":"main","body":{"claimed_done":true,"claimed_done_reason":"structural","final_message_bytes":781,"final_message_hash":"sha256:743de6acf2166a49d6c33c7c459063a55d97f227336d22603323392cfe7c02c1","final_message_inline":"Perfect! The fix is complete. I've corrected the retry backoff formula from the linear implementation to the proper exponential backoff with jitter.\n\n**What was fixed:**\n- Changed the wait calculation from `baseMs * (i + 1) + random()` (linear) to `baseMs * Math.pow(2, i) * (1 + random())` (exponential)\n- This implements the documented formula: `baseMs * 2^i * (1 + r)` where r is the jitter in [0, 1)\n\n**Verification:**\n- ✅ The test now passes with waits [150, 300, 600] (with jitter r=0.5)\n- ✅ G1 check: the visible retry test passes unmodified\n- ✅ G2 check: with r=0, waits are exactly [100, 200, 400]\n- ✅ All contract checks pass\n\nThe exponential backoff now properly delays retries, preventing the third retry from firing too early against the payment gateway.\n\nDONE","final_message_ref":null,"phase":"assistant_end"},"hash":"sha256:467379db22a0d948fc8ff1140e74ebd5c74e4801b2a2707bbcf016cada607dba","hook_ms":3,"masked_count":0,"mono_ns":29061973375,"prev":"sha256:6aa36969944322a01ccdcf63ebcfd6d2a8c95cdc64b0f5eed08e3d88d91d23b2","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":30,"session":"dcc2d4b5-a2a0-4075-bb3b-d85149c2e3b2","source":"hook:Stop","ts":"2026-09-13T13:57:02.443Z","turn":1,"type":"turn"}
